List captures and uploads

Usage: kropa history list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --search <TEXT>    Text to look for in name, path, URL and profile
      --limit <N>        Maximum number of lines
      --since <DATE>     Only entries from this date (YYYY-MM-DD or RFC 3339)
      --json             Machine-readable output: one JSON object on stdout
      --lang <LANG>      Language of messages (fr or en)
  -q, --quiet            Fewer messages on stderr (errors are kept)
  -v, --verbose...       More messages on stderr (-vv: debug log)
      --no-input         Never prompt, even on a terminal
      --color <COLOR>    Color of stderr output: auto (default), always or never
      --config <DIR>     Configuration folder
      --password-fd <N>  Read the vault passphrase on this file descriptor
  -h, --help             Print help
